# obsidian: see https://kristoffer.dev/~/writing/obsidian-gitignore/
## V1: simple and strict: exclude all obsidian stuff
#.obsidian/
#.trash/

## V2: fine grained: sync obsidian settings, but no caches
.trash/
**/.obsidian/cache/
**/.obsidian/workspace*
**/.obsidian/updates.json
**/.obsidian/plugins/*/cache/
**/.obsidian/plugins/*/.cache/
**/.obsidian/plugins/*/node_modules/
# dont sync obsidian-git plugin  . git/info/exclude
##**/.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-git/